  "application_type_full": "Removal/Variation of a condition",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;In the absence of a Transport Statement or Transport Assessment to demonstrate that the\r\nproposed extended operating hours would not adversely affect the transport\r\nnetwork, highway safety or sustainable travel objectives, the proposal would adversely impact on the free flow of traffic in the locality to the detriment of highway and pedestrian safety. The proposal\r\ntherefore fails to demonstrate compliance with, in particular, London Plan Policy T1 and Policy\r\nT16.3 of the Merton Local Plan.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;=&quot;&quot; mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;ms=&quot;&quot; mincho&quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;=&quot;&quot; mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:ja;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed extension of the permitted hours of operation to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:=&quot;&quot; &quot;times=&quot;&quot; new=&quot;&quot; roman&quot;;mso-ligatures:none;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=&quot;&quot; en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;10:00-02:00 Monday to Wednesday and 10:00-03:00\r\nThursday to Sunday together with the absence of a Noise and Premises Management Plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot; arial&quot;,sans-serif;=&quot;&quot; mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;ms=&quot;&quot; mincho&quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;=&quot;&quot; mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:ja;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;would result in unacceptable noise and disturbance to nearby residential\r\noccupiers, to the detriment of residential amenity. The proposal is therefore\r\ncontrary to, in particular, London Plan Policy D14 and Merton Local Plan Policy P15.10, which\r\nseek to protect existing and future occupiers from adverse impacts arising from\r\nnoise and disturbance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
  "decision": "Approved",
